WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.060
Oh?

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:05.440
Unidentified cruiser currently 
approaching at high speed.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.170
<i>The people I hold dearest,</i>

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.180
<i>and the future we'll achieve together...</i>

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.660
<i>I've made up my mind to
 protect them, no matter what.</i>

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.580
<i>I'd be lying if I said I'm not afraid, but...</i>

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:31.050
<i>As long as these bonds exist, 
no one can beat me!</i>

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:42.350
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:42.350
~The Red Queen Hypothesis~

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:44.950
<i>"Queen."</i>

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.730
<i>The one who possesses her genes</i>

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.350
<i>can bless those who have 
special powers, Evolvers,</i>

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:52.630
<i>with even greater power, 
clearing a path to the future.</i>

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:54.800
<i>When the Queen truly awakens,</i>

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>will the world achieve further evolution, or...</i>

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:17.990
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.620
"Bonds"

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:40.930
Did we get them?

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:57.340
Let's split up here.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.870
Victor, you go and take control 
of the ship, like we planned.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:01.760
You'll be all right?

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:02.570
Of course!

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.370
I'll find Hades and put a stop to his scheme.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:12.030
Be careful.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:12.990
You, too.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.170
Is that...

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.100
Intruder!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.350
Gavin?!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.100
Thanks, Gavin.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.510
That Evol just now...

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.590
I'll take out the communications systems.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.490
<i>We have two objectives.</i>

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:09.010
<i>One of them is to destroy the system 
on this ship that's hijacking</i>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:13.000
<i>antennas all around the world to 
broadcast the waves that awaken Evols.</i>

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.270
<i>Access granted.</i>

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.030
Why are the fire doors closed?

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.940
What the heck is happening?

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.030
We've been locked in!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:25.950
<i>The other is...</i>

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:29.870
<i>While Gavin is destroying the system 
and Victor is buying time,</i>

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:35.420
<i>I will use the Queen's power 
to take down Hades.</i>

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.840
Trust your instincts.

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:56.980
<i>Are you somewhere on
 this ship, too, Lucien?</i>

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:25.670
Kiro...

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:27.300
Is that you, Kiro?

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.250
Kiro!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.260
You're okay! I'm so glad...

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:37.670
I always had faith that there was 
no way you'd go down like that!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.190
Who are you?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.240
B-But you're...

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:45.960
I mean...

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.460
<i>What's going on? What...</i>

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.910
<i>His face looks just like him, but... 
is this someone else?</i>

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.610
<i>He does have a completely 
different air about him, but...</i>

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.500
Out of the way.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.430
Is Hades at the other end of this?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.730
Hades is my prey. Don't interfere 
where you're not needed.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:15.100
What do you mean?

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.290
Don't move!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.830
This is as far as—

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.100
You're... Helios?!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:51.090
<i>So he really isn't Kiro?</i>

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.810
What is it you're after?

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.940
I came to put a stop to Hades's ambitions.

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:05.900
Are you planning to fight Hades, too?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.280
I came to take his research results.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.660
If you get in my way, I will show no mercy.

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:21.890
What is this? It's pitch black. 
I can't see anything.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:26.090
Welcome to my castle of shadows.

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:43.120
The Queen's power is 
beyond your control, Hades.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:44.970
Helios.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:50.190
As a fellow member of 
Black Swan, I respect you...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:53.060
but this is my domain.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.280
Get them.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.460
What is that?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.250
Hades, your opponent is me!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:53.100
Oh?

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:56.340
The Queen offers to challenge me herself?

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.060
How very valiant.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:01.670
In that case, I must invite you 
to a more fitting location.

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:20.950
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.960
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.050
What is this place?

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:38.590
This is the origin of the abyss I control.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.130
From the distant past to the present age,

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:44.590
all of the dark memories that drift in the 
depths of the hearts of humans are here.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:48.230
The very darkness that people are 
in constant fear of, that they avoid,

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.400
serves as the source of my Evol.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.150
There is no means of escape.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.860
Not even for you, the Queen.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.610
I have no intention of running.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.180
I came to defeat you.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.980
Why don't you face me head-on, fair and square?

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:06.580
How very valiant, my young Queen.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:11.400
<i>Remember...</i>

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:16.170
I will force the world to evolve in your place.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.030
So the Queen's power has finally awakened.

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:29.390
Hades...

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:47.860
Your genes will cull the world 
and lead us to a new future!

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:52.170
A world built for the chosen... 
for Evolvers alone!

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:03.060
And all of it will bow before me.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.640
I will never let that happen!

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:08.610
That power of yours will be mine, as well.

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.780
Down to the last of my bullets...

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.290
Straight ahead?

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:07.030
Physical isolation is ineffective.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:09.910
So the only option is to
 lure the enemy this way.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:24.110
Trampling beautiful things goes 
far beyond bad manners.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.860
What... was that?

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.860
How unfortunate for you.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:48.670
I have the divine protection of the true 
Queen who rules over all worlds.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.890
The true Queen...

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:55.560
Someone a young, immature Queen like 
you could never see. The end of the abyss.

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:59.590
The one who transcends all of time 
and space: the Black Queen!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.840
You will be a living sacrifice to her.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:23.210
Your power will become 
a part of the true Queen.

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:28.030
And as the one under her protection, I will 
gain the power to rule over all Evolvers.

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:32.610
I will... never let that...

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.860
<i>Not yet... I can't...</i>

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:53.890
<i>I have to save... everyone...</i>

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.700
<i>No...</i>

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:05.530
<i>I won't... give...</i>

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.140
<i>Papa...</i>

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:15.880
I see.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.930
In that case, I'm going to have to 
work hard so you don't show me up!

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:24.210
You always follow through when 
you decide to do something, right?

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:24.900
Yeah!

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:28.900
I'm gonna make a super amazing show 
and make everyone smile!

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.840
I can't wait.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.200
I know you can do it.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:35.810
Because you're my daughter,
and I'm proud of you.

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:39.520
Papa!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.030
<i>Silly.</i>

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.080
<i>Was the resolution you showed that day</i>

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:52.490
<i>something that could be 
crushed by something like this?</i>

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.330
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:57.620
<i>I will protect the world you will return to.</i>

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:01.370
<i>You just follow the path you believe in.</i>

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.040
<i>You can do it, Potato Chip Princess!</i>

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.300
<i>One day, I promise I'll be back.</i>

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.170
<i>In the future where all this 
has ended, let's meet again!</i>

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.800
<i>How long do you plan to stay half-asleep?</i>

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.550
<i>I've gambled everything on your future.</i>

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.270
<i>Show me the world you will create.</i>

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:24.090
<i>They're all waiting beyond this darkness.</i>

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.120
<i>So I will also...</i>

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.280
<i>charge forward!</i>

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.890
Wh-What is this?

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.290
What's happening?!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.860
Wh-What?!

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:12.150
This is my order to you.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:13.610
Disappear.

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:48.270
This isn't possible...

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:52.560
You used my darkness to empower
 your allied Evolvers?!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.990
Hades, you cannot evolve...

00:16:55.990 --> 00:17:00.910
Because true evolution spreads through 
the strength of one's bonds with others.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.760
By trusting each other

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:05.870
and hoping for the future
as we move ever forward,

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.830
we will find our miracle.

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:15.490
Impossible! How is this happening?!

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:18.240
How could the likes of you...

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:24.890
The darkness!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.440
The darkness I received from the true Queen!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.240
Worthless.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.340
Everyone... Are you all right?

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:13.890
<i>Code confirmed.</i>

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:16.000
<i>Data on the Forced Evolution
 of Humanity Program</i>

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.410
<i>and all related projects has been deleted.</i>

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:39.690
<i>The microchip contained information 
on stimulating the sleepers' brain waves</i>

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:42.090
<i>and data on the specific frequency needed.</i>

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:45.970
<i>The medical equipment 
developed based on that data</i>

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:50.850
<i>allowed people to safely wake from 
the nightmares Black Swan had caused.</i>

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.980
<i>The world is rapidly 
regaining its former peace.</i>

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:02.620
<i>I think it's still too soon to officially 
announce the existence of Evolvers.</i>

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:06.220
<i>Considering the way recent events unfolded...</i>

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.480
<i>Right now, it would only cause 
misunderstandings and confusion.</i>

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.240
<i>But I want to believe that one day, 
we'll live in a world where everyone</i>

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:19.080
<i>can understand each other 
and walk alongside each other.</i>

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:23.950
<i>Since then, I haven't been able 
to see scenes of the future.</i>

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:28.470
<i>It's possible I used up all my 
power in my fight with Hades.</i>

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:28.470
Take what you like

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.060
<i>But even if we can't see it, 
even if we have to go slowly,</i>

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.060
<b>A Taste of Kindness</b>

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:36.840
<i>at our own pace, step by step...</i>

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.990
<i>We will clear a path to new evolution.</i>

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.950
President, it's just about time.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:43.950
All right.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.610
<i>After leaving the task force,</i>

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:49.630
<i>I switched my affiliation to a secret 
military team commanded by my father,</i>

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:51.760
<i>where I continue to hunt Black Swan.</i>

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.260
<i>What I must do has not changed.</i>

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:58.920
<i>I will put everything I have on 
the line to protect this world.</i>

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:08.540
<i>Even if one of us should make 
a mistake and fall into ruin,</i>

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:11.310
<i>we will not stop moving forward.</i>

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:16.460
<i>But we should change our approach slightly...</i>

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:19.600
<i>to a method that doesn't rely on such 
unstable factors as the Queen,</i>

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:22.200
<i>a method that leads to new evolution.</i>

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:26.770
<i>In the darkness, I protect the light.</i>

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:31.250
<i>To do that, I must immerse 
myself in the darkness.</i>

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:37.810
<i>I will gain control over everything 
here, and then I will return.</i>

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:41.270
<i>Because that's what I promised that day.</i>

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:47.260
<i>Peace has returned to the city.</i>

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.360
<i>And the fate that encircled her...</i>

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.810
<i>But this doesn't mean it's over.</i>

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.040
<i>This is the beginning.</i>

00:20:58.510 --> 00:21:02.490
<i>As long as she keeps moving forward, 
I will be able to see</i>

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:06.000
<i>the future of this world, 
and what lies beyond evolution.</i>
